@startuml
title Diagram 1 — Konteks Sistem: CRM Multi-Tenant TLab (fokus sales)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

actor "Sales Rep" as SR
actor "Sales Manager" as SM
actor "Tenant Admin" as TA
actor "Manajemen /\nHead of Sales" as MG

rectangle "CRM Multi-Tenant TLab" as CRMBOUND {
  component "CORE CRM — SALES\n(lead, kontak & akun, peluang,\nkuota, laporan; stabil — tidak\ndimodifikasi per klien)" as CORE
}

cloud "Sistem Klien\n(di luar CRM)" as EXT
component "Service Eksternal\n(buatan klien)" as SVC

SR --> CORE
SM --> CORE
TA --> CORE
MG --> CORE

CORE ..> EXT : event outbound\n(webhook, async)
EXT ..> CORE : data masuk\n(webhook inbound)
EXT --> SVC : meneruskan event

note right of SVC
  Kustomisasi klien dibangun DI SINI,
  bukan dengan mengubah core.
end note

note bottom of CORE
  Dikelola per tenant dengan isolasi
  data antar tenant.

  Lingkup = business process SALES.
  Domain service (ticketing) di luar lingkup.
end note
@enduml
